{{Documentation|doc=
This is a [[Template:Navbar|navbar]] used at the top of modding pages to assist with user navigation. A navbar differs from a [[Template:Navbox|navbox]] in that it is intended to link to broad overview pages rather than being an exhaustive list of objects.

== Usage ==
{{tlx|Navbar_modding}}
{{Navbar_modding}}

<code><nowiki>{{Navbar_modding|no-news=}}</nowiki></code>
{{Navbar_modding|no-news=}}

{{Translation guide|{{Note|Any strings not listed below don't need to be translated, as they will use the page title instead. Please see {{tll|Title}} for this.}}
<syntaxhighlight lang="wikitext">
{{#switch: {{{1|}}}
| #default = {{Error|translation}}
}}
</syntaxhighlight>}}

=== Parameters ===
; {{Code|no-news}}
: When provided, hides the modding news section in the navbar. (no value needed)

== See also ==

{{ll|Category:Navbar}}
}}
